@AuditSpoolApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5089

### Audit an order; the drain delivers it to the receiver within DrainInterval
POST {{AuditSpoolApi_HostAddress}}/orders/42

### The receiver forgets the current sealing key, so the next record is rejected with 422 sealing.unknown_key
POST {{AuditSpoolApi_HostAddress}}/receiver/forget-key

### Records the receiver stored and the key ids it knows
GET {{AuditSpoolApi_HostAddress}}/receiver/state

### Rejections the observer was told about and the current sealing key id
GET {{AuditSpoolApi_HostAddress}}/observer/state

### Log an error, which steps the log level up
GET {{AuditSpoolApi_HostAddress}}/demo/error
